 	  This driver uses SCPI Message Protocol to interact with the
 	  firmware providing all the clock controls.
 
+config COMMON_CLK_SDP1804
+	bool "Samsung SDP1804 (Nike-L) clock controller (read-only)"
+	depends on ARCH_SDP || COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on OF && HAS_IOMEM
+	default ARCH_SDP
+	help
+	  Exposes the PLL and fixed divider rates of the Samsung SDP1804
+	  (Nike-L) DTV SoC as configured by the boot loader. The driver
